# Velocity Host — backup exclude list (operator-editable)
# =====================================================================================
# Extra paths to EXCLUDE from the hourly offsite backup — one pattern per line.
# This file is YOURS to edit. The 15-minute converge creates it once and then NEVER
# overwrites it, so your changes are safe.
#
# ALREADY EXCLUDED (you do NOT need to list these):
#   - the live database files (/var/lib/mysql) — the DB backup handles databases
#   - restic's own cache
#   - known WordPress backup-PLUGIN output (UpdraftPlus, BackupBuddy/Solid Backups,
#     Duplicator, WPvivid, BackWPup, All-in-One WP Migration, WP STAGING, WP Time
#     Capsule, WPBackItUp, Total Upkeep, Backup Migration) — curated centrally + kept
#     current for you.
#
# WHEN TO ADD A LINE:
#   You have a large REDUNDANT folder bloating the backup — a custom/manual backup
#   dir, a big regenerable cache, a scratch/temp dir. NOTE: excluding something means
#   it will NOT be recoverable. Only exclude what you can afford to lose.
#
# HOW TO WRITE A PATTERN (restic syntax):
#   - a bare name (no slash) matches that file/dir ANYWHERE:   my-scratch
#   - an absolute path matches exactly:                        /home/alice/public_html/dump
#   - use  *  where the ACCOUNT NAME goes, so ONE line covers EVERY account:
#         /home/*/public_html/wp-content/my-custom-backups
#   - use  **  to match across any depth:                      **/throwaway-cache
#   - globs work:                                              /home/*/public_html/**/*.iso
#
# SAFETY — NEVER write these (they would exclude your WHOLE backup):
#       /      *      **      /home      /home/*      /etc      /var      /usr/local
#   The tool screens these out + warns automatically, but don't rely on it — keep
#   every pattern SPECIFIC (point at a folder, never a top-level root).
#
# AFTER EDITING, validate (lists each pattern as ok / DANGEROUS):
#       /usr/local/bin/vps-tooling/restic_backup_v1.sh validate-excludes
# =====================================================================================
